    "text": "News4Jax.com\nwebsite\nWaycross\nThunderstorms are moving out of SE GA, mild and muggy night\n8 hours ago\nStrong to isolated thunderstorms rumbled across the viewing area this afternoon, toppling trees and leaving puddles behind. Thunderstorms are winding down while they move north of Waycross, GA. These will be outside of our viewing circle by 11 p.m. tonight. Hot and muggy through Friday with highs in the 90s...",
